0..42 Comment "// This source tests native list patterns."
43..45 Comment "//"
46..117 Comment "// A list pattern names the empty list, elements, a rest binding and an"
118..160 Comment "// as-pattern binding for the whole value."
161..163 Comment "//"
164..241 Comment "// The compiler turns each pattern into a list case over the empty list and a"
242..317 Comment "// cell. A list\'s tail stands one stage below the list. So a recursive rest"
318..349 Comment "// match descends structurally."
350..352 Comment "//"
353..439 Comment "// - see: `pathological/builtins/list-patterns.gandr` — unmatched and mixed patterns"
441..485 Comment "// This import provides native finite lists."
